{"channelId":"UCbUdB8wiNrja52fDHVhP2Kw","row":["Fabled Farm Rescue & Sanctuary",1790,"Meet April & Bryan:\nWhen I met Bryan in 2014, he worked in insurance and had never had a pet! I owned my photography business of 20 years and lived in East Nashville. By the time we got married in 2016, we had 5 dogs and a cat and knew we were ready to get out of the city. Moving to the country and starting a nonprofit rescue farm and animal sanctuary soon became a dream for both of us. Join us on this rescue journey, and together we can make a difference!\n\nFabled Farm Rescue & Sanctuary is a Middle TN based 501(c)3 committed to accepting and placing unwanted equines, farm animals, and kittens in qualified, loving forever homes, while continuing care for the unadoptable animals with medical or behavioral issues through our sanctuary program. In only a few short years Fabled Farm has helped over 500 animals and continues to expand its community outreach and programs.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCbUdB8wiNrja52fDHVhP2Kw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCbUdB8wiNrja52fDHVhP2Kw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:10:04.498Z","channelId":"UCbUdB8wiNrja52fDHVhP2Kw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"96887e246f03a310b7ca74d020df5714e0e8ff7900ad3e2b028ecd886c1f98c4","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"03717cf401b9db91268ba4141f1ec0d4944192ee0636bb26f97b24908b4cee27"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCbUdB8wiNrja52fDHVhP2Kw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:10:04.498Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCbUdB8wiNrja52fDHVhP2Kw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":1790,"raw":"1.79K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCbUdB8wiNrja52fDHVhP2Kw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:10:04.498Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["animal rescue"],"relevantKeywords":["animal rescue"